Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 05:44:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add shared strength ranking; sort by strength; retire
 bmk_screener_v3

Add rank.py and wire it into export_scan.py so every hit carries a
strength_score and the screened list is sorted strongest-first (was volume
ratio). The three screeners watermelon shares with the StrategyTerminal repo -
trending, gaining_momentum (Momentum) and meta_leader (M.E.T.A.) - use formulas
byte-identical to StrategyTerminal/rank.py, so those three produce the SAME
stocks in the SAME strength order in both apps. The other three screeners
(early_uptrend, reversal, base_breakout) remain watermelon-only.

Drop the retired bmk_screener_v3.py and its tests_screener_v51.py; the live
scan and backtest both use the screener.py CHECKS engine.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
